# Served by Workers Assets.

# WebMCP is disabled outright in a document whose agent cluster is not
# origin-keyed, and registerTool then rejects with SecurityError. The Worker
# used to add this, but the Worker no longer runs for static paths now that
# run_worker_first is off, so it belongs here instead.
/*
  Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1

# Handoff pages carry noindex regardless of how a crawler found the link, so a
# shared link never turns into a search result.
/h/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
